| II    | THC23       | PP‑sFP400‑THC23:CBD1      | 23.0%      | ±2%       | 21.0 – 24.9%     | <1.0%     |
| III   | THC19       | PP‑sFP400‑THC19:CBD1      | 19.0%      | ±2%       | 17.0 – 20.9%     | <1.0%     |
| IV    | THC15       | PP‑sFP400‑THC15:CBD1      | 15.0%      | ±2%       | 13.0 – 16.9%     | <1.0%     |
| V     | THC9        | PP‑sFP400‑THC9:CBD1       | 9.0%       | ±4%       | 5.0 – 12.9%      | <1.0%     |

Total THC is calculated as (THCA × 0.877) + Δ9‑THC. The label tolerance for finished product is ±10% per Ph. Eur. 3028; the acceptance ranges above reflect internal target tolerances.

**General Analytical Parameters – Acceptance Criteria (All Grades)**

| # | Parameter                | Method / Reference                     | Acceptance Criteria                     | Notes                                      |
